<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Commerce Bancorp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Commerce Bancorp cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards said on Monday it lowered its rating on the shares of Commerce Bancorp Inc to a maintain from an accumulate, due to valuation.</p>
<p>-- &quot;This is a company we like very much but the stock is better reflecting its growth potential than ever before,&quot; analyst David Stumpf said.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 7/8 at 37-3/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
